WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.240
Where they mean to land.

00:01.965 --> 00:03.810
This is the Moon's south pole.

00:04.243 --> 00:10.328
Some crater floors here never receive light from the Sun, and they have kept water ice for billions of years.

00:10.806 --> 00:14.996
Ice is water to drink, air to breathe and fuel for the journey home.

00:15.654 --> 00:18.816
This is the region the Artemis flights are meant to explore.
